### Get all authors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Author

### Get author by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Author/id/1

### Get author by ID (alternative format)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Author/1

### Create new author
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Author
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Jane",
  "middle_name": "Marie",
  "last_name": "Doe"
}

### Update author
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Author/id/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "first_name": "John",
  "middle_name": "Michael",
  "last_name": "Smith"
}

### Patch author (partial update)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Author/id/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Johnny"
}

### Delete author
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Author/id/1

### Get books by specific author (if relationship endpoint exists)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Author/1/books